   "value": "<p><strong>Install:</strong> Hospital<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb<br>\n<strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 14 (4d6)</p>\n<p>Paired Cyberlegs with pre-installed Grip Feet and 2 option slots. Allows user to move without penalty on all metal surfaces at any orientation, including upside down. When used on a metal surface, user cannot be knocked prone.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Cyberleg (Foundational)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> provides 2</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One item is the pair of legs: install it once. Its 2 slots are the 2 option slots of each leg, so a paired option uses one of them.</li>\n<li>The Grip Feet are built in and use none of the slots. Moving on metal is not automated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Cyberware).</em></p>"
